name: "image-msch"

version: v1
minGameVersion: 159

displayName: "Image.msch"
description:
  '''
[white[]] This mod adds ability to share schematics via png images.[[]]

[accent[]] [#FFF000[]]Features:[[]]
[white[]] Export schematic-images and share them with your friends (or enemy).[[]]
[white[]] Dropdown images to import schematics.[[]]

 How does it works?
[white[]] The game stores schematics either as msch files or base64 encoded strings. This mod stores schematic data inside png file sector for metadata.
By that you can both share and show your schematics at the same time.[[]]
  '''

author: "NiTiSon"

main: "nitis.imageMsch.ImageMschMod"
java: true

# This makes mod available in multiplayer?
hidden: true
